'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page one of the [[Force of Law Premium Warbond#Page 1|Force of Law]] Premium [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|45|notext}} and 30 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

